TEXT 80 -64 Left 3 ;#356 Negative clipping limit of a single NPN emitter follower
TEXT 80 -8 Left 2 ;Source: Alan Wolke (W2AEW), https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8f-nhjQ1jMk
TEXT 80 32 Left 2 ;With a 1k emitter resistor to -10 V and a 1k load to ground, the output cannot go below -5 V.
TEXT 80 96 Left 2 ;The NPN cannot sink current; the two 1k resistors set the negative limit when Q1 turns off.
TEXT 80 720 Left 2 !.tran 0 5m 0 2u
TEXT 80 752 Left 2 !.meas tran VOUT_MIN MIN V(OUT)
TEXT 80 800 Left 2 ;The 1 kHz input frequency only illustrates clipping; Alan's drawing specifies the voltage range.
